# Tower Clash — iOS build request (MM-12, docs/MOBILE.md §3.2).
#
# Pushing a change of this file to the branch claude/tower-war-game-plan-weqwpb starts
# .github/workflows/tower-clash-ios-release.yml once: signed archive on a macOS runner, upload to
# App Store Connect (it then appears under TestFlight). Pushes to any other branch start nothing.
# Without the four Apple secrets the run stops in its first step, "Check required secrets".
#
# Keys (one key=value per line; lines starting with # are ignored; unknown keys are an error):
#   lane       testflight (default) or appstore — the same upload; appstore is the build meant
#              for App Review and warns when the AdMob ids are missing
#   note       free text for the log, at most 200 characters (why this build)
#   requested  UTC time of the request, e.g. 2026-10-09T15:30:00Z — change it every time so the
#              commit is a real diff (GitHub only starts the run when this file changes)
#
# The build number is config.buildNumber in tower-clash/package.json (npm run version:sync);
# App Store Connect accepts every build number only once.
lane=testflight
note=build 8 (1.0.0) retry 3: archive with the Apple Distribution identity (no development profile, no device needed); TestFlight only
requested=2026-10-09T22:00:00Z
